Description: Edge Smart Panel for deepin desktop
 EdgeBar is a slide-out panel anchored to the screen edge.
 .
 Features:
  * System Monitor: real-time CPU gauge, memory bar, network graph, temperature
  * Clipboard History: search and re-copy recent clipboard items with pin support
  * Quick Launch: fuzzy search applications and system commands
  * Pomodoro Timer: 25-min focus sessions with circular progress
  * DTK blur + theme-adaptive UI
  * DConfig for persistent settings
